达 38.6 万美元","summary":"JPMorgan 在 2027 年长期资本市场假设中预测 Bitcoin 10 年后牛市情景价格将接近 38.5 万美元，基准情景年复合回报率为 10%。该模型赋予 65% 权重于货币供应量增长，且认为与黄金和美股的 0.10 和 0.33 相关系数过差不稳定，目前暂不纳入战略投资组合。","sourceName":"CryptoSlate","sourceUrl":"https://cryptoslate.com/jpmorgan-models-bitcoin-reaching-385000-in-10-year-bull-case-despite-ceo-jamie-dimons-criticism/","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T20:30:10.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":5,"citationId":"lx4po19dri1vfpx1w190mbiei"}]},{"label":"股票市场","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"超微电脑初步业绩大超预期 股价盘后涨超12%","summary":"超微电脑发布2027财年第一季度初步业绩，营收预计185亿至195亿美元，远高于此前145亿至155亿美元指引，股价盘后上涨约12%至16%。公司同步上调毛利率展望至12%-12.5%，并设定2027财年营收目标650亿至720亿美元。戴尔、惠普企业和英伟达股价同步走高。","sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/super-micro-shares-rally-preliminary-sales/","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T01:13:41.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"超微电脑业绩远超预期，AI服务器同业戴尔、慧与科技盘后大涨","summary":null,"sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784079","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T00:06:28.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"vpsj8dz0o3bz6k81no5xz0uxh"}],"citationId":"emz0waqc2oo393cnlndnlovpn"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"波音 737 Max 10 获认证 助力扭亏竞争空客","summary":"波音 737 Max 10 获得长期等待的认证，将帮助该公司在航空公司寻求更大、更高效机型的背景下与空客竞争，支撑扭亏努力。","sourceName":"Financial Times","sourceUrl":"https://www.ft.com/content/0e99c2bc-873c-4d2d-b5c9-a0876faeb9ed?syn-25a6b1a6=1","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T20:43:44.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"z04mkyfebh6jek53adm5m7go3"},