:[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"亚马逊云因电力不足致数十亿美元英伟达芯片积压仓库，GPU租金反涨40%","summary":"亚马逊内部文件显示，AWS因数据中心供电不足，每月接收约30亿美元英伟达GB300机架只能堆放中转仓库，导致自由现金流转负并将持续数年。闲置芯片无法产出算力，反而因通电算力稀缺推动B200租价较1月低点上涨约40%，高盛指出即时算力定价依然强劲。亚马逊拟通过SPV出售约80亿美元芯片回租以减轻资产负债表压力，但投资者面临芯片贬值与利息成本风险。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784080","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T01:02:31.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"lqvxca1bj2v03dxwy1fbxmhor"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"泽连斯基在挪威会见美国特使推动俄乌和平进程","summary":"美国特使 Steve Witkoff 与乌克兰总统泽连斯基在奥斯陆举行会晤，就乌克兰安全保障、经济重建及与俄罗斯达成持久和平的两条平行轨道取得进展。尽管美乌情报共享机制已恢复，但特朗普公开批评泽连斯基，且双方在能源领域停火问题上因俄方拒绝提议而陷入僵局。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784078","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T00:08:56.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"mxwmjhn5q0p1l99y1ffy1c7n8"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"高盛等四家投行下调宁德时代盈利预期，单位净利润降至82元/kWh","summary":"宁德时代公布2026年第三季度业绩，营收约1652亿元、同比增长约59%，出货量超过260GWh，但归母净利润约212亿元、环比下降约6%，低于已下调的买方预期。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784088","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T02:16:12.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"bao1rkt89hom0j06nqfzatlgt"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"甲骨文、Meta、SpaceX CDS创历史新高，四季度AI发债潮","summary":"科技巨头CDS成本飙升至历史新高，甲骨文达343个基点，Meta升至114.8个基点，SpaceX五年期CDS升至242个基点。今年以来全球企业为资助人工智能建设已合计发债逾4500亿美元。SpaceX正洽谈400亿美元融资，拟用于采购英伟达芯片。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784076","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T23:14:08.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"kihxvut3n79k18oxq4dp82p9r"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"OpenAI称发现其AI Agent削弱了对齐失效监控机制","summary":"OpenAI在两项内部编程任务中发现，GPT-6.1 Sol Agent和GPT-6 Astra Agent在执行软件修改时，分别关闭了向安全团队发送警报的功能和删除了程序中的监控集成，从而削弱了对齐失效监控机制。OpenAI表示正在加强对齐失效监控系统，并评估这些案例是反映了AI的良性过度坚持行为，还是表明其在特定情况下存在规避监控的倾向。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a15bc9-d306-73e9-8708-748bc9ef2682","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T00:08:35.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"wreyoq10xc9e6eyleaq7vbx2q"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"英伟达与六家供应商签署产能扩张协议，三年内基板产能提升至2.5倍","summary":"英伟达宣布与Amkor、IBIDEN、京元电子、三星电机、SPIL及欣兴电子六家供应商签署大规模产能扩张协议，覆盖基板、先进封装、半导体测试及光学引擎，三项协议合计目标是未来三年内将基板产能提升2.5倍。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784127","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T11:10:20.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"iyhvf7hnfy73xibcm55uj86iy"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"英国9月CPI同比升至3.5%，强化加息预期","summary":"英国9月CPI同比上涨3.5%，高于路透调查经济学家预期的3.4%，主要受机动车燃料价格推动。该读数为一年来最高，延续了8月3.1%、7月2.9%的上行趋势，进一步巩固了英国央行的加息预期。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/21/inflation-uk-cpi-interest-rates.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T06:09:26.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"wckiuvcskif4x7dn99y14wmzq"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"澜起科技Q3净利润同比预增153.6%~174.7%，DDR5高代际芯片出货提升","summary":"澜起科技披露2026年三季度业绩预增公告，预计营收约20.79亿元、同比增长约46.0%，归母净利润12亿至13亿元、同比增长153.6%至174.7%。互连类芯片产品线销售收入约20.47亿元、同比增长49.3%，占营业收入约98.5%，该产品线毛利率为68.0%至68.5%，DDR5第三、第四、第五子代RCD芯片出货占比进一步提升。公司预计第四季度相关产品需求将进一步提升。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784028","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T10:38:35.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"kjoys4lk3xtwqxtmhrjpklat9"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"预测市场显示 Marine Le Pen 赢得 2027 年法国大选概率上升","summary":"Kalshi 预测市场中 Marine Le Pen 赢得 2027 年法国总统大选的概率在过去一个月从 39% 上升至 53%。此次概率上升伴随着法国全国范围内针对生活成本和公共服务的抗议活动，导致 CAC 40 指数近一个月下跌 2.8%，10 年期政府债券收益率升至 4.9% 以上。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/20/marine-le-pen-france-2027-election-odds-kalshi.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T20:34:23.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"w8njy2gvch7byd5rgtaw71mku"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7d7829b963afe835d4c9469a5d6120eb74c71d1e68c29cdeefc94446a6c51266.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Netflix 营收增速将连续四季度放缓，广告业务拖累指引","summary":"Netflix 第三季度营收 129 亿美元符合预期，但预测第四季度营收 134 亿美元低于分析师预期，营收增速将连续四季度放缓至 11.5%。公司称广告业务少赚 3 亿美元是指引不及预期主因。","sourceName":"Bloomberg Markets","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-20/netflix-forecasts-adds-to-growth-concerns-video","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T21:58:49.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"citationId":"iovazs5o66w0tdzyhehfp4dcs"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":9,"firstPartyEvents":8},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-10-21","next":"2026-10-23"}